    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d301">

                <pb facs="0443" n="421" sameAs="frus:frus1951v02/pg421"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">320/12–2251: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        United States Representative at the United Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Austin</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1952-01-07T18:50:00-05:00">January 7, 1952—6:
                            50 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    Gadel 624. Dept still considering future tactics membership question. FYI we see serious objections to procedure (Delga 799, Dec 22) whereby US wld use no
                    influence prevent adoption Sov omnibus Res and abstain.</p>
                <p>Request Del’s estimate re probable date SC action
                    membership.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
